{
  "$schema": "./schema.json",
  "specVersion": 1,
  "id": "ps0_invsq",
  "parityScene": "PS-0",
  "title": "PS-0 逆二乗の距離テスト(点光源 400 cd の下の長い床。物理ライティング単位)",
  "description": "床の上で光源から 1〜12 m の距離が一度に写り、明るさが約 2 桁落ちる。逆二乗 1/d² と cosθ が正しくないとパストレーサーとの差が距離とともに広がる。",
  "status": "ready",
  "notes": [
    "床は反射率 0.5・粗さ 1。光源は床から 1 m の高さ(sourceRadius 2 cm)。EV100=4.5",
    "太陽・空なし(直接光だけ)",
    "パストレーサーは bounces=1(直接光 + 環境の可視性つき NEE のみ)。PS-0 は光の単位・露出・トーンマップ・BRDF の校正で、間接光(GI)は別段階(DDGI / SSGI / Lumen 風 GI)の担当。bounces=8 の全光輸送との差は既知の差として PARITY_Q2_REPORT.md に数値を載せる"
  ],
  "scene": {
    "source": "generator",
    "script": "gen/ps0_calibration.py",
    "args": {
      "variant": "invsq",
      "units": "physical",
      "cd": 400,
      "ev100": 4.5
    },
    "scene": "scenes/ps0_invsq.json"
  },
  "cameras": [
    {
      "name": "along",
      "position": [
        0.0,
        3.0,
        -6.5
      ],
      "target": [
        0.0,
        0.0,
        4.0
      ],
      "note": "床の奥行き方向。距離とともに暗くなる"
    },
    {
      "name": "side",
      "position": [
        -5.0,
        2.0,
        1.0
      ],
      "target": [
        0.0,
        0.0,
        3.0
      ],
      "note": "斜め。cosθ(入射角)の効き"
    }
  ],
  "engine": {
    "resolution": [
      1920,
      1080
    ],
    "size": [
      1920,
      1080
    ],
    "linear": true,
    "mode": "headless",
    "warmupFrames": 60,
    "settleFrames": 8,
    "png": "srgb",
    "features": {
      "ddgi": false,
      "ssgi": false,
      "ssr": false,
      "ssao": false,
      "taa": false,
      "lightingUnits": "physical",
      "ev100": 4.5,
      "tonemapper": "ue_filmic"
    },
    "requiresMethods": [
      "render_reference"
    ]
  },
  "reference": {
    "kind": "pt",
    "pt": {
      "spp": 1024,
      "seeds": [
        1,
        2
      ],
      "format": "pfm",
      "api": "engine",
      "timeoutSec": 1800,
      "params": {
        "bounces": 1,
        "lightFalloff": "physical"
      }
    },
    "external": {
      "colorspace": "auto",
      "provenance": "手動撮影の UE / 別エンジンの画像を references/ps0_calibration/<camera>.png に置く"
    }
  },
  "alignment": {
    "tonemap": "ue_filmic",
    "exposure": "ev100:4.5",
    "sizePolicy": "error",
    "ppd": 67
  },
  "displayCheck": {
    "mean_lsb_max": 0.6,
    "p99_lsb_max": 2.0,
    "max_lsb_max": 4.0
  },
  "gates": {
